# {{pluginName}}

Twilight Echo controlled UI tool plugin scaffold.

This template registers a `playerBarButton` command. The same API also supports
controlled `settingsPanel`, `sidebarPage`, `localSidebarItem`, and
`streamingHome` contributions. Return plain text or structured data from
commands; arbitrary plugin-provided HTML is not a supported extension path.

`@twilight-echo/plugin-api` and `create-twilight-plugin` are currently available from the Twilight Echo source tree, not the npm registry. Set up the local development dependencies as described in the [plugin development guide](https://github.com/Px-asen/Twilight_Echo/blob/Pxasen/docs/PLUGIN_README.md) before running these commands.

```bash
pnpm test
pnpm run pack
```
